      "content": "It makes complete sense that you feel trapped because the weight of \"everything depending on you\" can feel impossible to lift alone.\nPlease know that suicide is not the only way to stop the pain, and escaping your life physically often just begins the same difficult journey over again.\nThere are safe, immediate resources like 988 (the Suicide and Crisis Lifeline in the US) where you can talk to a real person who is there to help you find a way to stay and be free without dying.\nYou don't have to fix \"it all\" to be safe; you can just talk to someone today to carry the load for a little while.",
